description.narrative:
(i)	Stakeholder effects  Increased access to MSE finance: IFC anticipates that the Project will contribute to increased access to finance to MSEs and individuals in Tajikistan and help narrow the MSME access to finance gap in Tajikistan;  
(ii)	Stakeholder effects  Increased access to housing microfinance: By directing 50 % of the total project resource envelope to housing finance, this Project is expected to contribute towards the reduction of the access to housing microfinance gap in Tajikistan; 
(iii)	Competitiveness: IFC expects that the Project will promote the competitiveness of the microfinance market in Tajikistan through the competition channel.
